  "name": "Control Network A",
  "cellSizeM": 2.0,
  "notes": [
    "Tier 3: every patrol is paired, there are no service doors, and every slot is filled (fill probability 1.0).",
    "Straight top and bottom lanes with a stepped middle lane. Route A has a conveyor (A2), a loop, a gate (A3) and a final hazard (A4), ending with the final code note.",
    "Route B has a cart ride (B2), a gate (B3) and a final hazard (B4), ending with the final token. Route C ends in the final service cart (C4) that rides into the module's service tunnel.",
    "A3, B3 and C3 accept the carried T2_OPS and T1_MAINT permissions as optional shortcuts.",
    "The control-room module control_room_v1 is stitched at anchor [48,2]; routes end at x=47 on rows 4, 12 and 20."
  ],
